      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Tuning socket buffers, ring buffers, and backpressure for high-throughput networking",
      "source_hash": 15772002981422808005,
      "context_hash": 16835553333589858995,
      "translation": "고처리량 네트워킹을 위한 소켓 버퍼, 링 버퍼, 백프레셔(backpressure) 튜닝",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "ring buffer": "링 버퍼",
        "throughput": "처리량"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:33.448645Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The buffer hierarchy",
      "source_hash": 17584717016834622252,
      "context_hash": 10188937241777171275,
      "translation": "버퍼 계층 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:33.448645Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Network data flows through several buffering layers, each of which can be a bottleneck:",
      "source_hash": 13640984256034851517,
      "context_hash": 13451956115011832359,
      "translation": "네트워크 데이터는 여러 버퍼링 계층을 거쳐 흐르며, 각 계층이 병목 지점이 될 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:33.448645Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Socket buffer tuning",
      "source_hash": 1636213410756278214,
      "context_hash": 9553806820876260784,
      "translation": "소켓 버퍼 튜닝",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:33.448645Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "TCP auto-tuning",
      "source_hash": 9783567920534650390,
      "context_hash": 8442925279003407469,
      "translation": "TCP 자동 튜닝",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:33.448645Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "By default, TCP auto-tunes socket buffers based on observed bandwidth-delay product:",
      "source_hash": 18390620174713830062,
      "context_hash": 10553198829765921417,
      "translation": "기본적으로 TCP는 관측된 대역폭-지연 곱(bandwidth-delay product)을 바탕으로 소켓 버퍼를 자동 튜닝합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP",
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:33.448645Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Manual buffer sizing",
      "source_hash": 1371109132995690908,
      "context_hash": 6140522146087656846,
      "translation": "수동 버퍼 크기 설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:33.448645Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "UDP buffer sizing",
      "source_hash": 13331803649394698670,
      "context_hash": 7053156516649743726,
      "translation": "UDP 버퍼 크기 설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "UDP": "UDP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:33.448645Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "UDP has no flow control — if the application reads slowly, packets are dropped:",
      "source_hash": 3808555618560800210,
      "context_hash": 15211179774037416825,
      "translation": "UDP에는 흐름 제어가 없으므로, 애플리케이션이 느리게 읽으면 패킷이 드롭됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "UDP": "UDP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:33.448646Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "NIC ring buffer tuning",
      "source_hash": 7113031197268656997,
      "context_hash": 14423148140899905734,
      "translation": "NIC 링 버퍼 튜닝",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NIC": "NIC",
        "ring buffer": "링 버퍼"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:33.448646Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The NIC maintains DMA ring buffers for TX and RX.",
      "source_hash": 15535989538028769668,
      "context_hash": 7962721386046270228,
      "translation": "NIC는 TX와 RX용 DMA 링 버퍼를 유지합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DMA": "DMA",
        "NIC": "NIC",
        "ring buffer": "링 버퍼"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:33.448646Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "If they fill up, packets are dropped before they reach the kernel:",
      "source_hash": 16409837809718945876,
      "context_hash": 15284765827463491393,
      "translation": "링 버퍼가 가득 차면 패킷은 커널에 도달하기 전에 드롭됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:33.448646Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Ring buffer drops are visible in:",
      "source_hash": 17891539318256229502,
      "context_hash": 15330947885014687745,
      "translation": "링 버퍼 드롭은 다음에서 확인할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "ring buffer": "링 버퍼"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:25:33.448646Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
